      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Perusal of the complaint on the record of the Adjudicating Authority reveal that appellant No.1 is Food Business Operator-cum-Incharge of mini DLCP of M/s. Vestige Marketing Pvt. Ltd."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cff677c5e8f5413db54bb4a0c1d6cc5d_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The appellant No.2 is proprietor of M/s.Vestige Marketing Pvt. Ltd."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "df2d83585a344d969a9a5f31dab74362_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Appellant No.3 is the nominee of the supplier unit of accused No.5 i.e. Ms. Vestige Marketing Pvt. Ltd. and No.4 is the nominee of the marketing unit-cum- registered office of accused No.5 i.e. Ms. Vestige Marketing Pvt. Ltd."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d78c7654eb4c441aafb8bae72ed5126e_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Appellant No.5 is storage-cum-wholesale branch and supplier of appellant No.1.\n9."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "01dd96dc903b48e1b070fba0c24be062_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "From the application filed by the respondent department before Adjudicating Authority, it is clear that these appellants are Food Business Operators only."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3f7f38005a104658b766dc9d706fe841_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 26 of the Act provides responsibilities of the Food Business Operator."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "45b275f26baa4a83b689fff85f3fd2ec_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The relevant section 26(4) runs as follows :\n\"26(4). No food business operator shall sell or offer for sale any article of food to any vendor unless he also gives a guarantee in writing in the form specified by regulations about the nature "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "7220da07c250462f9dc95bdcd72fc944_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nProvided that a bill, cash memo, or invoice in respect of the sale of any article of food given by a food business operator to the vendor shall be deemed to be a guarantee under this section, even if a guarantee in the specified form is no"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "5d9cb8c163584beeb5dac81642ef28e5_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Section 80(B)(2)\n(d) provides defence of due diligence."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1f926930ee86438cba4244d3ab8c79d3_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The relevant part of this Section runs as follows :\n\"S.80. Defences which may or may not be allowed in prosecution under this Act."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9ce269dff55e439dbb004b6a25e5751e_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(B)\nDefence of due diligence- (1) In any proceedings for an offence, it is a defence if it is proved that the person took all reasonable precautions and exercised all due diligence to prevent the commission of the offence by such person or "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b58a07bf1cf747b7bed17bc2554e1d4d_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "11. It is not the case of the respondent if appellants had made any changes/alterations in the food article which they had received from manufacturer i.e. M/s. A.P. Organics Limited for sale."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "62384c4371644b14bfbebc5613fd0eec_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It is also not the case of the respondent that the plea raised by Ld. Counsel for the appellant U/s.26 (4) of the Act is not applicable to the appellants."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "dac154d006fe44a09c1c479bd68fd7c2_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "RATIO"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The Adjudicating Officer has not given any reason that why ignoring Section 26(4) and Section 80(B)(2) and (d) of the Act, he has imposed penalties on the appellants."
    },
    {
